---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { imageUrl } from '../../lib/image-assets';
import "../../styles/story-hero.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Story | Roots & Relics Greenhouse"
  description="Meet Pat and Jenn and discover the story behind Roots & Relics Greenhouse, a 35-acre farm and antique destination near Klamath Falls, Oregon."
  currentPath="/our-story/"
  bodyClass="inner-page story-page"
>
<main class="page-main story-main" id="main">
      <section class="story-hero" aria-labelledby="story-title">
        <div class="story-hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src={imageUrl('r-r-greenhousse-25.jpg')} alt="" data-parallax />
        </div>
        <div class="story-hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="story-hero-content">
          <p class="kicker reveal">Our story · Southern Oregon</p>
          <h1 id="story-title" class="reveal">It was never really <br />about <em>antiques.</em></h1>
        </div>
        <div class="story-hero-stamp reveal" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>ROOTS &amp; RELICS</span>
          <b>R&amp;R</b>
          <span>EST. IN OREGON</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="story-beginning" id="the-beginning">
        <div class="story-section-heading reveal">
          <p class="kicker">The beginning</p>
          <h2>The memories.<br />The traditions.<br /><em>The friendships.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="story-beginning-copy reveal">
          <p class="story-lead">Some of the best things begin on a back road, with nowhere else you need to be.</p>
          <p>Pat and Jenn both grew up in small towns where community was everything. Estate sales, flea markets, back roads, and conversations with collectors slowly became some of their favorite ways to spend time together.</p>
          <p>Over time, they realized that the objects themselves were only part of the story.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="story-founders reveal">
          <div class="story-founders-frame">
            <img src={imageUrl('129-pat-and-jenn.jpg')} alt="Pat and Jenn, founders of Roots and Relics, seated together in the greenhouse" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption><strong>Pat &amp; Jenn</strong><span>Collectors, caretakers, and the people behind the greenhouse.</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
        <aside class="story-founders-note reveal" aria-label="A note from Roots and Relics">
          <span class="story-quote-open" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
          <p>What we bring home matters.<br />Who we share it with matters more.</p>
          <span class="story-quote-close" aria-hidden="true">”</span>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="story-stewards" aria-labelledby="stewards-title">
        <div class="story-stewards-image reveal">
          <img src={imageUrl('74-portraits-sideboard.jpg')} alt="Old family portraits and collected objects displayed on an antique sideboard" loading="lazy" />
          <span>The marks of another life are worth preserving.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="story-stewards-copy reveal">
          <p class="kicker">Our philosophy</p>
          <h2 id="stewards-title">Temporary stewards of other people’s <em>stories.</em></h2>
          <p>Pat and Jenn are drawn to evidence of use: rubbed edges, old repairs, faded paint, and the small details that cannot be manufactured.</p>
          <p>They do not erase those marks. They care for them, share what they know, and make room for the next chapter.</p>
          <p class="story-source-note">Pieces are sourced from farms, estates, and private collections across the Midwest and East Coast.</p>
          <a class="action-link story-light-link" href="/the-collection/">What we collect <span>→</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="story-farm" aria-labelledby="farm-title">
        <div class="story-farm-heading reveal">
          <p class="kicker">The place</p>
          <h2 id="farm-title"><em>Thirty-five acres,</em><br />ten minutes from town.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="story-farm-intro reveal">
          <p>Roots &amp; Relics sits on a 35-acre farm approximately ten minutes outside Klamath Falls, Oregon.</p>
          <p>Here, the farm itself sets the pace: quiet paths, passing birds, and more sky than schedule.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="story-owls reveal">
          <img src={imageUrl('125-farm-owls.jpg')} alt="Four barn owls perched in the rafters on the Roots and Relics farm" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Spring visitors in the rafters.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="story-farm-notes" aria-label="Life on the farm">
          <article class="reveal">
            <h3>At the pond</h3>
            <p>Geese and ducks share the water while hawks and bald eagles pass overhead.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="reveal">
            <h3>In the pasture</h3>
            <p>Cows and calves make their home here alongside chickens and seasonal wildlife.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="reveal">
            <h3>Always nearby</h3>
            <p>Three beloved goats answer to Walter, Betty, and Barry White.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="story-pause" aria-label="Roots and Relics philosophy">
        <img src={imageUrl('r-r-greenhousse-24.jpg')} alt="The Roots and Relics greenhouse on the farm in Southern Oregon" loading="lazy" data-parallax />
        <div class="story-pause-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <blockquote class="reveal">“Beautiful places have a way of slowing us down in the <em>very best way.</em>”</blockquote>
      </section>

      <section class="story-invitation" aria-labelledby="invitation-title">
        <div class="story-invitation-copy reveal">
          <p class="kicker">Come wander</p>
          <h2 id="invitation-title">We’d love to<br /><em>meet you.</em></h2>
          <p>The greenhouse opens for select weekends throughout the year—and quietly, by appointment, in between.</p>
          <div class="story-invitation-actions">
            <a class="solid-link" href="/before-you-visit/">Plan your visit <span>→</span></a>
            <a class="action-link action-link-dark" href="/private-showings/">Private showings <span>↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="story-invitation-aside reveal">
          <p>A warm welcome.<br /><em>A slower pace.</em></p>
          <span>Southern Oregon · Approximately ten minutes from Klamath Falls</span>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
